    {
      "type": "faq",
      "id": "faq",
      "title": "Questions.",
      "items": [
        {
          "q": "We already have a style guide. Isn't that enough?",
          "a": "A style guide describes how things should look. A design system is what teams actually build with: the same tokens and components in design files and in code."
        },
        {
          "q": "Do we have to rebuild our products?",
          "a": "No. I start with the tokens and the most-used components, then move one product over at a time."
        },
        {
